 14808	/// # The upstream defect this works around
 14809	///
 14810	/// A vec0 plain-TEXT metadata column stores a 16-byte inline view per row: a
 14811	/// 4-byte length plus the first 12 bytes of the value
 14812	/// (`VEC0_METADATA_TEXT_VIEW_DATA_LENGTH`). A value longer than those 12 bytes
 14813	/// ALSO gets a row in the `<tbl>_metadatatext<NN>` shadow table.
