 14837	///
 14838	/// # The workaround
 14839	///
 14840	/// Blank the `attr_*` columns FIRST. vec0's UPDATE path takes the `n <= 12 &&
 14841	/// prev_n > 12` branch (`sqlite-vec.c:8300-8319`), which deletes the shadow row
 14842	/// AND returns `SQLITE_OK`, then the DELETE no longer has an over-length value to
 14843	/// clear. Measured: the `embedding` bytes and the other metadata columns survive
 14844	/// the metadata-only UPDATE verbatim, and the `_metadatatext<NN>` row is gone —
